  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-07-18T11:26:21.813Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The new avatar scaling system in beta currently allows the user to select their scale using a mirrorview of their avatar, then the viewpoint camera and IPD will snap to that selected height. Let's call this Snap Avatar Scaling. Similar to how comfort modes give users options, I feel there should be a Smooth Avatar Scaling option to allow for the viewpoint camera and IPD to shift while scaling from the radial menu, for advanced VR users wishing to have a more immersive experience.",
